<title>POLAND: ECHO FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>ECHO FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
